<title>UK: Yorkshire B/S ups five-year FRN to 200 million stg.</title>
<headline>Yorkshire B/S ups five-year FRN to 200 million stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yorkshire Building Society's five-year FRN, launched earlier, has been increased to 200 million stg from 150 million stg, lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said on Tueday.  </p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   SPREAD     +8 BP     MATURITY	 OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    09.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A2/A	ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.18</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7 BP	SELL CONC  11 BP     PRAECIP     NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
